<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-11-10T18:01:23.604Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 18:01:23 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Salvadoran forces have intensified their offensive in Haiti, killing gang leader Mathias Saintil and destroying the mansion of a 400‑member Mawozo gang leader, while President Bukele warned Haitian gang leaders that his troops will finish them as in El Salvador. Haitian leader is traveling to El Salvador to discuss the Salvadoran offensive, and four Salvadoran technicians disappeared after an ambush, prompting Bukele to deploy 2,500 troops. Amnesty International urged that the deployment respect human rights, and the conflict produced 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxQTzM1SUxvakZDNV9scm9PYXg4bDVJOE5BZnI1dFlqZ3p5cG1oTVVFNHFWcTQ1N1c3enhQWGU5Ym5uNzd0NjBWbmlxU1ZsOHlaRnI3Qko5dFFzbXcyY3l2N3AxZl9faldvOUJlWXVpVkhEZGQ4QVY4T2o5MG9SRTdTSnQtMkJRdUU2cjdpYlVKY2dCZHJRUnNNTzgtS1ZXamR3WHpuRWhWU1FKYnVDQ0s2VjRiTHIwZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxPanQyNmxhM0ZCZ1ltQVFqeHVZY3NncFlFc3BvcmVUUWY2RmJpQ0REOFJnWUM2Z2o0MDJMN1AwVVRaR05HOUo2QUpHbW1XUUQtRlZsRkhwTEppOVM1NmZuQmphcTFyaW1kNE95blZTZVBBX25ldFg3M3V5RHJSdEx0T3paT08yNnNESmVScDc1WkRrV1RyVjAyYTdUUnRyRGw1?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNRjhBNkNQbUM3a0FPLXdUTERGbTBDMzhHTkptOVpkUmxjay1rZHFBVklReHE1Y0ROTGtsb2x4a0dqSUpSTl9aNDBnei1UX0xaaWJxSG9jelJvdVl3bDRRdTIzNFVXM1Vfcmg2QlVvaEFYOTdVaVZZa1NtejFEaExyN2NDc1B1ZjJ1LUFzcEt2b3V0TmhPVldIaURB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hoodline&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxPYmVnNFhhSnh3WjdKV0RuZWtUZXFOaW9fd2NUMEVPbmpFYnFNQThWM25KbUxYODZfTzBVdTVyQWs5dzZycVJJMzJfa3R3b0xfaS1nbEVDOGxrTVZrVkg3UUhIdjRpd3lWczNuRkpHSG80LXAya0x3dVBBU